ÿØÿÛ«symbol D-flop-B-source
  «type: X»
  «description: D-flop / D flip-flop B-source (Trigger Selectable)»
  «library file: |.subckt D-flop-B-source D CLK Q ¬Q\nB1 Latch 0 V=if(trigger==0,(V(CLK)>=thres)&(state(1,V(CLK))<thres),(V(CLK)<=thres)&(state(1,V(CLK))>thres))\nB2 lastQnow 0 V=if(time<=0,IC,state(1,V(Qnow)))\nB3 Qnow 0 V=if(V(Latch), if(V(D)>thres,1,0) ,V(lastQnow))\nB4 ¬Q 0 V=!V(Q)\nB6 Q 0 V=state(1,V(Qnow))\n.ends D-flop-B-source»
